":["Deals Arts damage and gains increased ATK depending on the number of units the target is blocking.","Attacks restore HP proportional to damage dealt","Leaves behind <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":100,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"sarkaz_heirbearer_annihilator":{"slug":"sarkaz_heirbearer_annihilator","name":"Sarkaz Heirbearer Annihilator","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Heirbearer Annihilator.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An elite long-range bombardier of the Sarkaz Royal Court that has received the blessing of the Sanguinarch of Vampires. They do not aim at any particular target or tangible enemy. The only thing reflected in their eyes is ruination itself.","abilities":["Deals long-ranged attacks that explode after a delay, inflicting Physical damage in an area.","Will be reborn as a <Touch of Benevolence> after falling in battle for the first time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":550,"def":150,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_boneguard_fluxcaster_captain":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_fluxcaster_captain","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Fluxcaster Captain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Fluxcaster Captain.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A Sarkaz Caster responsible for guarding the Feranmut's skeleton, their nature warped due to perpetually drifting through spacetime along with it, to the point that their very existence has become tenuous. In times of emergency, they will call upon the Feranmut's power to hide within the turbulent folds of spacetime before reappearing at a more opportune time to deliver a fatal blow.","abilities":["If defeated within range of a Bloodcalling Altar, slips into a turbulence in spacetime and cannot be attacked during this period.","Will revive on the field when affected by an altar's pulse."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":420,"def":300,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_boneguard_captain":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_captain","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Captain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Captain.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A guard captain responsible for protecting the Feranmut's skeleton. As some of the most fervent adherents of the Military Commission, they will realize the Commission's will at any cost, even if they must shed their own blood.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked by friendly units.","Upon receiving damage, reduces the ASPD of the attacker.","Prevents <Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bombs> from moving when nearby.","Leaves behind 2 <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":1100,"def":1500,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.8}},"sarkaz_boneguard_torturer":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_torturer","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Torturer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Torturer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An elite armsmaster responsible for protecting the Feranmut's skeleton, carefully selected by the most senior members of the Military Commission. The degree of their fusion with the Feranmut's nerves defies common understanding, with their ancient witchcraft drilled deep into their bodies.","abilities":["Recovers a portion of HP and gains increased ATK when either enemy or friendly units are defeated within range (can stack).","Leaves behind 2 <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":1200,"def":1200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_heirbearer_scourger":{"slug":"sarkaz_heirbearer_scourger","name":"Sarkaz Heirbearer Scourger","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Heirbearer Scourger.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An elite formation-breaker of the Sarkaz Royal Court that has received the blessing of the Sanguinarch of Vampires. Said to have disobeyed the Sanguinarch's will, however the Sanguinarch did not punish them for their transgressions. In return, these warriors convert their regret into endless slaughter and wash away their guilt with blood.","abilities":["After several attacks, Stuns friendly units in an area.","Will be reborn as a <Gift of Magnanimity> after falling in battle for the first time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":35000,"atk":1500,"def":100,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"duqarael_regents_crimson":{"slug":"duqarael_regents_crimson","name":"Duq'arael, 'Regent's Crimson'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Duq'arael, 'Regent's Crimson'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"The Host of the Crimson Court, and master of all bloodborn. A drop of Teekaz blood once flowed through his body, and its last remaining purity has returned to the land. Now, he has his sights set on the King of Sarkaz once again. He smiles, declaring that he has already slain one such King, and plans to bid farewell to the final one.","abilities":["First Form","[Moon-Devouring Bloodmist] Releases a searing Blood Mist centered around a target, inflicting increasing amounts of Arts damage to allied units within while reducing their ASPD and increasing their Redeployment Time. Pieces of Blood Amber affected by this Blood Mist will turn into Bloodborn Spawn.","[Blood Surge] When defeated, this skill will activate 4 times, selecting one target each time (prioritizing units that have not been hit). Deals Arts damage to the target and all units in the adjacent 4 tiles and stuns them.","When defeated, returns to the Throne of Blood and revives after a period of time.","Enters second form when the Throne of Blood is destroyed.","Second Form","Takes greatly reduced Physical and Arts damage and increases the HP recovery rate of other surrounding enemy units (this trait will be lost for a while when this unit is hit by an <Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb>)","[Blood Affliction] Attacks deal continuous Arts damage that ramps up over time. If the target leaves the field during this duration, their Redeployment Time will be greatly increased.","[Crimson Edict] Continuously spawns <Blood Amber> around this unit for a period of time. Afterward, Blood Mist will be released centered around this unit.","[Sunken Death] When struck by an <Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb>, destroys the corresponding bomb loading point, and releases [Blood Surge] twice."],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":850,"def":450,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"anti_witchcraft_repositionable_bomb":{"slug":"anti_witchcraft_repositionable_bomb","name":"Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb","icon":"/enemies-icons/Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A bomb whose explosion can suppress the effects of Sarkaz witchcraft, with a prototype delivery platform originating from Victoria. After being modified by a certain demolition expert, it has become a trump card in our desperate battles.","abilities":["Neutral unit; will be prioritized by both enemy and friendly units.","Movement Speed is slowed when attacked by an enemy unit, but increased when attacked by a friendly unit.","Explodes upon reaching a Bloodcalling Altar, dealing a large amount of True damage to surrounding enemies and destroying the Altar."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":500,"def":200,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}}},"dropIcons":{"4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png"},"previewFile":"h13-4.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[{"col":1,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_126_outset","kind":"device","name":"Bomb Loading Point","row":1},{"col":4,"description":null,"hidden":true,"key":"trap_126_outset","kind":"device","name":"Bomb Loading Point","row":7},{"col":4,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_125_bonore","kind":"device","name":"Bloodcalling Altar","row":7},{"col":9,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_127_bldore","kind":"device","name":"Throne of Blood","row":2}],"playbackPaths":{"0":{"points":[[4,5],[3,5],[2,5],[1,5],[0,5]],"distances":[0,1,2,3,4],"length":4,"breaks":[],"flying":false,"holds":[{"at":0,"seconds":120,"point":[4,5],"tunnel":false}],"nodes":[[4,5],[0,5]]},"1":{"points":[[6,7],[6,6],[5,6],[4,6],[3,6],[2,6],[1,6],[0,6]],"distances":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"length":7,"breaks":[],"flying":false,"holds":[{"at":0,"seconds":120,"point":[6,7],"tunnel":false}],"nodes":[[6,7],[6,6],[5,6],[0,6]]},"2":{"points":[[5,6],[4,6],[3,6],[2,6],[1,6],[0,6]],"distances":[0,1,2,3,4,5],"length":5,"breaks":[],"flying":false,"holds":[{"at":0,"seconds":120,"point":[5,6],"tunnel":false}],"nodes":[[5,6],[0,6]]},"3":{"points":[[4,3],[3,3],[2,3],[1,3],[1,2],[0,2]],"distances":[0,1,2,3,4,5],"length":5,"breaks":[],"flying":false,"holds":[{"at":0,"